### Owner: Ruth  ·  US04 US06 TS01 TS05 sensors, US15 US25 analytics
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### US06 sensors with their state
GET {{baseUrl}}/sensores

### One sensor
GET {{baseUrl}}/sensores/1

### TS05 state (online if the last reading is at most 5 minutes old, R11)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sensores/1/estado

### TS01 reading from the microcontroller (no token) -> 201 { "id": 8 }
POST {{baseUrl}}/sensores/1/lecturas
Content-Type: application/json

{ "peso": 2.0 }

### Sensor that does not exist -> 404 SENSOR_NOT_FOUND
POST {{baseUrl}}/sensores/999/lecturas
Content-Type: application/json

{ "peso": 2.0 }

### Negative weight -> 400 INVALID_WEIGHT
POST {{baseUrl}}/sensores/1/lecturas
Content-Type: application/json

{ "peso": -3 }

### Reading far from the registered stock -> creates a DISCREPANCY alert (R20)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sensores/3/lecturas
Content-Type: application/json

{ "peso": 6.2 }

### US04 link the free sensor 4 to the Sugar product 4
POST {{baseUrl}}/sensores/vincular
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sensorId": 4, "productoId": 4 }

### Sensor 1 already has a product -> 409 SENSOR_IN_USE (R9)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sensores/vincular
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sensorId": 1, "productoId": 5 }

### US15 dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard

### US25 report of the month
GET {{baseUrl}}/reportes?desde=2026-11-01&hasta=2026-11-30